  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TRI-Landscape Restoration for Ecosystem Functionality and Climate Change Mitigation in the Republic of S o Tome e Pr ncipe (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, which is framed into the Reforestation Initiative (TRI) led by FAO, IUCN and UNEP, has the objective to promote the restoration and sustainable management of the forest ecosystems of S o Tome and Pr ncipe to reduce carbon emissions from deforestation, and stop and reverse forest and soil degradation</narrative>
  </description>
